with brain as well as brawn?</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/e72c232776dcea3210162fd6c782de65.poster.avif?t=1685965181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/e72c232776dcea3210162fd6c782de65.webm?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/e72c232776dcea3210162fd6c782de65.mp4?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Achievements / Relics:</strong> Fun feats that can be unlocked throughout the game provide Relics as rewards and they are added to your inventory on each play through. These relics are alien artifacts that can boost SAT-V\u2019s stats and skills. Once unlocked via Achievements, Epic and Legendary Relics provide unique boosts to your gaming style.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/d32c7d3f7430ec88e7b5c0beaec1b012.poster.avif?t=1685965181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/d32c7d3f7430ec88e7b5c0beaec1b012.webm?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/d32c7d3f7430ec88e7b5c0beaec1b012.mp4?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Customize Looks:</strong> You can customize look and feel of your ship with paint modes randomly looted from enemies. When unlocked, they are yours and you can use them on each play through.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/066277b3439571d027079527a75c10e4.poster.avif?t=1685965181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/066277b3439571d027079527a75c10e4.webm?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/066277b3439571d027079527a75c10e4.mp4?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Skirmish Mode:</strong> For casual players, fast skirmish mode with different world settings is also included. Each zone has a secret mini-boss to encounter. Are you up for the challenge for this <strong>space combat RPG</strong>? </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/5be4982ccff33c7bb1599d0fd5ed0288.poster.avif?t=1685965181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/5be4982ccff33c7bb1599d0fd5ed0288.webm?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/5be4982ccff33c7bb1599d0fd5ed0288.mp4?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Easter Eggs:</strong> Funny (and somewhat mysterious?!) easter eggs wait for you to be discovered. Can you solve the riddles of The Unfathomable Scholar ? Can you ?!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/73b106339910768fe265b8938cfff7ba.poster.avif?t=1685965181\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/73b106339910768fe265b8938cfff7ba.webm?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/73b106339910768fe265b8938cfff7ba.mp4?t=1685965181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Enjoy and breath in the rich atmosphere of Timewell Universe where SAT-V plays a key role in the survival of three galactic races. May you guide SAT-V to her destination through an adventure of deceit and suspense?<br><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/0de6a071295c9ca63709843788ded526.avif?t=1685965181\" /></div><br><br><strong>In the year 3099, earth had a major crisis of resources, pollution, and unjust economy. Governments controlled by megatechs invested in creating the ultimate artificial intelligence with a personality to increase their reach in the galaxy.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/9882a4cf73835cbd7eb8a263e132f1d8.avif?t=1685965181\" /></div><br><br>SAT-V (Super Adaptive Tech), the latest version of artificial intelligence research was designed to overcome perils with unparalleled ingenuity as well as firepower.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/c899a1131180ba91313f29029c53bd1e.avif?t=1685965181\" /></div><br><br><strong>Burdened with the task of finding a goldilocks planet of bountiful resources, SAT-V got a mysterious signal of an unknown origin on the outskirts of Titan.</strong><br><br>Reaching the destination, SAT-V encountered a portal, a gaping hole in the fabric of spacetime. Without hesitation, it took the first step in the human history and made the perilous jump.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/5ee8e74b5659d1564ab4ca03b68f2d3d.avif?t=1685965181\" /></div><br><br><strong>After the spacetime jump, SAT-V had a startling revelation: an unknown entity emerged from SAT-V\u2019s cerebral nexus and took the leading role of her virtual personalities. Providing little information about its origin, the entity gave SAT-V various tasks to reach the final destination, where humanity will be rewarded by supreme beings mentioned as Celestes.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/29f026ac496acca561c8610ec4bcb98e.avif?t=1685965181\" /></div><br><br><i>Thus starts the Trail Of Celestes\u2026</i><br><br><strong>See you folks in the next cycle where the story continues ! :)</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745210/extras/d7f5a010a6fc035c86945e0b8364c4dc.avif?t=1685965181\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Dive into an immersive space shooter adventure with Timewell: Trail of Celestes. As SAT-V, explore new planets and fight against Constructs in a RPG storyline. Customize her skills and adaptations for a unique space combat experience. Are you ready to guide SAT-V through a perilous universe?",
